&lt;section data-background-color=&quot;var(--dk-color-surface-2)&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;horizontal-slide-with-directives&quot;&gt;Horizontal slide with directives&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;##&lt;/code&gt; opens a fresh horizontal slide. A slide directive paints its
background so the built &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;#x3C;section&gt;&lt;/code&gt; carries the applied attribute.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;fragment&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Slides are pre-rendered at build; reveal only enhances them.&lt;/li&gt;
